          "Some of it can stay where the day ended.",
          "You do not need to carry every responsibility into tonight.",
          "For now, the rest of it can wait until morning.",
          "Not all of it belongs in this moment."
        ][DateTime.now().millisecond % 5];

      case SleepState.relationship:
        return "Not all of this needs your attention right now.";

      case SleepState.loneliness:
        return "This moment does not need to hold the whole weight of that feeling.";

      default:
        return "It may not need quite as much space right now.";
    }
  }

  switch (state) {
    case SleepState.overthinking:
      return [
  "You do not need to keep watch over it right now. For now, it can stay where it is.",
  "Nothing more is needed from you tonight.",
  "You have carried enough of it for today.",
  "You do not have to solve it before you rest.",
  "The night does not require an answer from you.",
  "For now, it is safe to leave it where it is.",
  "You can let go of it for a little while.",
  "You do not need to carry it any further tonight.",
  "For now, you can leave it where it is.",
  "The rest of it can wait outside this moment.",
  "You have done enough with it for one day.",
  "It does not need anything more from you tonight.",
  "You can stop holding it for a little while.",
  "For the next few minutes, it can simply stay unresolved.",
  "You do not have to stay with it right now.",
  "It is okay to leave the rest for tomorrow's version of you.",
  "You can let this moment be smaller than the thing you are carrying.",
  "For now, the weight of it can be set down.",
  "Nothing is asking anything more from you tonight.",
  "You can leave the rest exactly where it is."
][DateTime.now().millisecond % 20];
    case SleepState.workStress:
      return [
  "You have carried enough of it for today. Nothing more is needed from you tonight.",
  "For now, the weight of the day can stay where it is.",
  "You do not need to carry the rest of it into tonight.",
